              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "A sensible KPI to watch is attributed conversion volume (for example, purchases or lead events with better event match quality), since the causal path is conditional: more matchable identifiers shared with TikTok can mean more events attributed to people, not more conversions actually happening; the trade-off is sharing more customer data versus stricter Manual-only setups that share fewer parameters.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
