        "kind": "partial_alternative",
        "difference": "Enhanced match is an optional addition to the Pinterest tag that sends hashed email addresses to Pinterest to match site events and conversions with the person responsible when no Pinterest cookie is present, enabling cross-device checkout tracking — whereas Advanced Matching matches a broader set of customer identifiers (email, phone number and other identifiers) with website actions shared through the TikTok Pixel, Events API or partner platforms.",
